{"evidence":[{"sentence_id":0,"text":"The 28th Test and Evaluation Squadron is an active United States Air Force unit.","title":"28th Test and Evaluation Squadron"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" Its current assignment is with the 53d Wing, based at Eglin Air Force Base, Florida.","title":"28th Test and Evaluation Squadron"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Eglin Air Force Base (AFB) (IATA: VPS, ICAO: KVPS, FAA LID: VPS) is a United States Air Force base located approximately 3 miles (5 kilometers) southwest of Valparaiso, Florida in Okaloosa County.","title":"Eglin Air Force Base"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"The 72d Test and Evaluation Squadron is part of the 53d Wing at Eglin Air Force Base, Florida.","title":"72d Test and Evaluation Squadron"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" The squadron is geographically separated but operated from Whiteman Air Force Base, Missouri.","title":"72d Test and Evaluation Squadron"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" It conducts testing and evaluation of the B-2 Spirit aircraft.","title":"72d Test and Evaluation Squadron"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"The 96th Test Wing is a United States Air Force unit assigned to the Air Force Test Center of Air Force Materiel Command at Eglin Air Force Base, Florida.","title":"96th Test Wing"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" The wing was activated at Eglin in 1994 as the 96th Air Base Wing, the headquarters for all support units on Eglin, the largest installation in the Air Force.","title":"96th Test Wing"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" In 2012, it absorbed the mission and resources of the 46th Test Wing and added the mission of testing and evaluating weapons, navigation and guidance systems and command and control systems.","title":"96th Test Wing"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"The Holloman High Speed Test Track (HHSTT) is a United States Department of Defense/Air Force aerospace ground test facility located at Holloman Air Force Base in south-central New Mexico.","title":"Holloman High Speed Test Track"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" It is adjacent to the White Sands Missile Range and is operated by the 846th Test Squadron of the 96th Test Group of the 96th Test Wing at Eglin Air Force Base.","title":"Holloman High Speed Test Track"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" The Test Track provides its services to a wide variety of American defense and governmental agencies such as the Air Force, Army, Navy, and the Missile Defense Agency, as well as America's allies.","title":"Holloman High Speed Test Track"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"The 49th Test and Evaluation Squadron is an active United States Air Force unit.","title":"49th Test and Evaluation Squadron"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" Its current assignment is with the 53d Wing, based at Barksdale Air Force Base, Louisiana.","title":"49th Test and Evaluation Squadron"}],"peer_messages":["Unverified peer answer: Eglin Air Force Base
